  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I use the Rift to play VRC and I run into other VR users a lot who have no idea how to do certain actions (this also includes PC users) so I, and other people alike, have to ask what system they use before anything and usually if they're having lag problems it's very difficult to get the answer that we need to help. I think it would be a good idea to add a token by the name tags saying what system they use like Vive, Rift, etc. This would smooth out the process and also make it easier to connect to others who may be having the same problems with the system as you do. Of course there would be a way to turn this off or only allow certain people to see it if nessisary but it would just be a good detail to make things easier.",
